{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;She is out there. You must find her. If you don\u2019t\u2026 she will die.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFind Me\u201d is an atmospheric psychological horror set deep in the forest.<br>You don\u2019t know who <i>she</i> is, or why you\u2019re drawn to her voice echoing through the trees but the only thing that matters is saving her before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The woods are not empty. Shadows move, whispers call your name, and every path feels wrong. As you search, the line between reality and nightmare begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Average time to complete the game:</strong>\u00a030\u201360 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, intense psychological horror experience;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Walking Simulator with strong narrative focus;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chilling forest environment full of secrets and fear;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden jumpscares that will test your nerves;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of clues, notes, and fragments that lead you closer to <i>her</i>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood, corpses, and disturbing imagery;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, immersive soundscape designed to keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0 <strong>WARNING:</strong><br>This game contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood and dead bodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing imagery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden jumpscares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror themes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not recommended for players with epilepsy or heart conditions.</p>","background":"https://store.aka